      "kind": "takeaways",
      "heading": "The short version",
      "html": "<ul><li>ESOS, the Energy Savings Opportunity Scheme, asks qualifying large UK undertakings to audit their energy use each phase.</li><li>SECR, Streamlined Energy and Carbon Reporting, asks many companies to report energy and carbon in their annual accounts.</li><li>Both need good site data: meters, plant and big energy uses.</li><li>Quickler gathers the site data. It does not work out ESOS or SECR figures or say if you qualify.</li></ul>"
